OL,3,GNEWSATwo women found dead inside house
OL,4,
OL,5,FTwo women have been found dead inside a
OL,6,Fhouse in Kenilworth, police have said.
OL,8,FOfficers discovered their bodies in
OL,9,FRounds Hill on Sunday evening after
OL,10,Fneighbours reported concern.
OL,12,FWarwickshire Police said the deaths of
OL,13,Fthe two women, one in her 60s and
OL,14,Fanother in her 40s, are not being
OL,15,Ftreated as suspicious.
OL,17,FParamedics from West Midlands Ambulance
OL,18,FService were also called to the
OL,19,Fproperty just before 18:00 BST but were
OL,20,Funable to assist the victims.
